{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_1", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_1.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah,\u2014some little difficulty about it, I suppose?", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "No, not at all; I thought it would be better to wait until the spring, because it is just at this time that people begin to think seriously about their summer quarters.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Quite right; you were perfectly right, Mr. Hovstad.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, Thomas is really indefatigable when it is a question of the Baths.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Well remember, he is the Medical Officer to the Baths.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, and what is more, they owe their existence to him.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "To him?", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Indeed!", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "It is true I have heard from time to time that some people are of that opinion.", "para": 6, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "At the same time I must say I imagined that I took a modest part in the enterprise.", "para": 6, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, that is what Thomas is always saying.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "But who denies it, Mr. Stockmann?", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "You set the thing going and made a practical concern of it; we all know that.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "I only meant that the idea of it came first from the doctor.", "para": 8, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, ideas yes!", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "My brother has had plenty of them in his time\u2014unfortunately.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "But when it is a question of putting an idea into practical shape, you have to apply to a man of different mettle, Mr. Hovstad.", "para": 9, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "And I certainly should have thought that in this house at least...", "para": 9, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "My dear Peter\u2014", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "How can you think that\u2014?", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Won't you go in and have something, Mr. Hovstad?", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "My husband is sure to be back directly.", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Thank you, perhaps just a morsel.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "(Goes into the dining-room.)", "para": 13, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann (lowering his voice a little).", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "It is a curious thing that these farmers' sons never seem to lose their want of tact.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Surely it is not worth bothering about!", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Cannot you and Thomas share the credit as brothers?", "para": 15, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "I should have thought so; but apparently some people are not satisfied with a share.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "What nonsense!", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "You and Thomas get on so capitally together.", "para": 17, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "(Listens.)", "para": 17, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "There he is at last, I think.", "para": 17, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "(Goes out and opens the door leading to the hall.)", "para": 17, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (laughing and talking outside).", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Look here\u2014here is another guest for you, Katherine.", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Isn't that jolly!", "para": 18, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Come in, Captain Horster; hang your coat up on this peg.", "para": 18, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah, you don't wear an overcoat.", "para": 18, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Just think, Katherine; I met him in the street and could hardly persuade him to come up!", "para": 18, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "(CAPTAIN HORSTER comes into the room and greets MRS. STOCKMANN.", "para": 18, "sent": 6, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "He is followed by DR. STOCKMANN.)", "para": 18, "sent": 7, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Come along in, boys.", "para": 18, "sent": 8, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "They are ravenously hungry again, you know.", "para": 18, "sent": 9, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Come along, Captain Horster; you must have a slice of beef.", "para": 18, "sent": 10, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "(Pushes HORSTER into the dining-room.", "para": 18, "sent": 11, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "EJLIF and MORTEN go in after them.)", "para": 18, "sent": 12, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "But, Thomas, don't you see\u2014?", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (turning in the doorway).", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, is it you, Peter?", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "(Shakes hands with him.)", "para": 20, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Now that is very delightful.", "para": 20, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Unfortunately I must go in a moment\u2014", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Rubbish!", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "There is some toddy just coming in.", "para": 22, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "You haven't forgotten the toddy, Katherine?", "para": 22, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "Of course not; the water is boiling now.", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "(Goes into the dining-room.)", "para": 23, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "Toddy too!", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, sit down and we will have it comfortably.", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "Thanks, I never care about an evening's drinking.", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "But this isn't an evening's drinking.", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "It seems to me\u2014.", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "(Looks towards the dining-room.)", "para": 28, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "It is extraordinary how they can put away all that food.", "para": 28, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (rubbing his hands).", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, isn't it splendid to see young people eat?", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "They have always got an appetite, you know!", "para": 29, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "That's as it should be.", "para": 29, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "Lots of food\u2014to build up their strength!", "para": 29, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "They are the people who are going to stir up the fermenting forces of the future, Peter.", "para": 29, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "May I ask what they will find here to \"stir up,\" as you put it?", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah, you must ask the young people that\u2014when the times comes.", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "We shan't be able to see it, of course.", "para": 31, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "That stands to reason\u2014two old fogies, like us.", "para": 31, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "Really, really!", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "I must say that is an extremely odd expression to\u2014", "para": 32, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, you mustn't take me too literally, Peter.", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "I am so heartily happy and contented, you know.", "para": 33, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "I think it is such an extraordinary piece of good fortune to be in the middle of all this growing, germinating life.", "para": 33, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "It is a splendid time to live in!", "para": 33, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "It is as if a whole new world were being created around one.", "para": 33, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 114, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you really think so?", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 115, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 116, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah, naturally you can't appreciate it as keenly as I. You have lived all your life in these surroundings, and your impressions have been blunted.", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 117, "kind": "action", "text": "But I, who have been buried all these years in my little corner up north, almost without ever seeing a stranger who might bring new ideas with him\u2014well, in my case it has just the same effect as if I had been transported into the middle of a crowded city.", "para": 35, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 118, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 119, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, a city\u2014!", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 120, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 121, "kind": "action", "text": "I know, I know; it is all cramped enough here, compared with many other places.", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 122, "kind": "action", "text": "But there is life here\u2014there is promise\u2014there are innumerable things to work for and fight for; and that is the main thing.", "para": 37, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 123, "kind": "action", "text": "(Calls.)", "para": 37, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 124, "kind": "action", "text": "Katherine, hasn't the postman been here?", "para": 37, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 125, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (from the dining-room).", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 126, "kind": "action", "text": "No.", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 127, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 128, "kind": "action", "text": "And then to be comfortably off, Peter!", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 129, "kind": "action", "text": "That is something one learns to value, when one has been on the brink of starvation, as we have.", "para": 39, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 130, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 131, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, surely\u2014", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 132, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 133, "kind": "action", "text": "Indeed I can assure you we have often been very hard put to it, up there.", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 134, "kind": "action", "text": "And now to be able to live like a lord!", "para": 41, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 135, "kind": "action", "text": "Today, for instance, we had roast beef for dinner\u2014and, what is more, for supper too.", "para": 41, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 136, "kind": "action", "text": "Won't you come and have a little bit?", "para": 41, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 137, "kind": "action", "text": "Or let me show it you, at any rate?", "para": 41, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 138, "kind": "action", "text": "Come here\u2014", "para": 41, "sent": 6, "present": []}, {"u": 139, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 140, "kind": "action", "text": "No, no\u2014not for worlds!", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 141, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 142, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, but just come here then.", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 143, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you see, we have got a table-cover?", "para": 43, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 144, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 145, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, I noticed it.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}]}